msgstr "일반 설정"
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 124
msgid "Power governors and platform profiles."
msgstr "전원 조절기 및 플랫폼 프로필."
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 132
msgid "CPU Governor: Performance"
msgstr "CPU 거버너: 성능"
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 133
msgid "Sets the CPU governor to 'performance' when GameMode is active."
msgstr "GameMode가 활성화될 때 CPU 거버너를 '성능'으로 설정합니다."
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 142
msgid "Platform Profile: Performance"
msgstr "플랫폼 프로필: 성능"
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 143
msgid "Sets the platform profile to 'performance' for maximum power."
msgstr "최대 전력을 위한 플랫폼 프로필을 '성능'으로 설정합니다."
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 153
msgid "iGPU Governor: Powersave"
msgstr "iGPU 거버너: 전력 절약"
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 154
msgid "Sets iGPU governor to powersave when under heavy load to balance power."
msgstr "무거운 부하가 걸릴 때 전력을 균형 있게 조절하기 위해 iGPU 거버너를 전원 절약 모드로 설정합니다."
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 161
msgid "CPU Optimizations"
msgstr "CPU 최적화"
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 171
msgid "Pin Cores (P-Cores)"
msgstr "핀 코어 (P-코어)"
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 172
msgid ""
"Keeps game threads fixed on high-performance cores, preventing the kernel from moving the game to "
"slow cores (E-cores) mid-action."
msgstr "게임 스레드를 고성능 코어에 고정시켜, 커널이 게임을 느린 코어(E-코어)로 이동하는 것을 방지합니다."
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 182
msgid "Park Efficiency Cores"
msgstr "파크 효율 코어"
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 183
msgid "Temporarily 'turns off' efficiency cores so the OS doesn't try to use them for the game."
msgstr "효율성 코어를 일시적으로 '끄는' 기능으로, OS가 게임에 사용하지 않도록 합니다."
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 193
msgid "AMD X3D Mode: Frequency"
msgstr "AMD X3D 모드: 주파수"
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 194
msgid "Shifts processes to frequency CCD while gaming. For 7950X3D/9950X3D."
msgstr "게임 중 주파수 CCD로 프로세스를 전환합니다. 7950X3D/9950X3D용."
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 203
msgid "Soft Realtime Scheduling"
msgstr "소프트 실시간 스케줄링"
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 204
msgid "Enables SCHED_ISO on supported kernels for reduced latency. 'auto' enables with 4+ cores."
msgstr "지원되는 커널에서 지연 시간을 줄이기 위해 SCHED_ISO를 활성화합니다. 'auto'는 4개 이상의 코어에서 활성화됩니다."
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 213
msgid "Renice Game Process"
msgstr "게임 프로세스 우선순위 변경"
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 214
msgid "Adjusts process priority for the game. Value 10 gives higher priority (requires gamemode group)."
msgstr "게임의 프로세스 우선 순위를 조정합니다. 값 10은 더 높은 우선 순위를 부여합니다(게임 모드 그룹이 필요함)."
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 223
msgid "I/O Priority: Maximum"
msgstr "I/O 우선순위: 최대"
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 224
msgid "Sets I/O priority to BE/0 (highest). Improves disk access for the game."
msgstr "I/O 우선 순위를 BE/0(최고)로 설정합니다. 게임의 디스크 접근성을 향상시킵니다."
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 231
msgid "GPU Optimizations"
msgstr "GPU 최적화"
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 240
msgid "Enable GPU Optimizations"
msgstr "GPU 최적화 활성화"
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 241
msgid "⚠️ Use at your own risk! Enables GPU overclocks and power settings."
msgstr "⚠️ 사용자는 자신의 책임 하에 사용하세요! GPU 오버클럭 및 전원 설정을 활성화합니다."
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 255
msgid "NVIDIA: Prefer Maximum Performance"
msgstr "NVIDIA: 최대 성능 선호"
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 256
msgid "Sets GPUPowerMizerMode to 1 (Prefer Maximum Performance). Requires coolbits (X11 Only)."
msgstr "GPUPowerMizerMode를 1(최대 성능 선호)로 설정합니다. coolbits가 필요합니다(X11 전용)."
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 264
msgid "NVIDIA: Core Clock Offset"
msgstr "NVIDIA: 코어 클럭 오프셋"
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 265
msgid "Adds MHz offset to core clock. Set to enable +100MHz offset (X11 Only)."
msgstr "코어 클럭에 MHz 오프셋을 추가합니다. +100MHz 오프셋을 활성화하도록 설정합니다 (X11 전용)."
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 273
msgid "NVIDIA: Memory Clock Offset"
msgstr "NVIDIA: 메모리 클럭 오프셋"
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 274
msgid "Adds MHz offset to memory clock. Set to enable +200MHz offset (X11 Only)."
msgstr "메모리 클럭에 MHz 오프셋을 추가합니다. +200MHz 오프셋을 활성화하도록 설정합니다(X11 전용)."
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 280
msgid "NVIDIA Options Unavailable"
msgstr "NVIDIA 옵션 사용 불가"
# 
# File: biglinux-games-settings/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-games-settings/games_page_old.py, line: 281
msgid "NVIDIA GameMode optimizations require an X11 session. You are currently using Wayland."
